education and publishing, with a particular emphasis on nutrition and dietetics. The group is known for producing a variety of educational materials aimed at healthcare professionals, which include guidelines and literature in the medical field. They hold copyright for several significant texts, including those focused on clinical nutrition, pediatric nutrition, and clinical nutrition and metabolism. Additionally, Grupo Aula Médica is involved in publishing works related to evidence-based medicine and oncology, further contributing to the advancement of medical knowledge and practices. Through their efforts, they aim to enhance the education and resources available to healthcare providers.", "EVIDENCIAS CLÍNICAS:Evidencias clínicas sobre el soporte nutricional en el paciente diabético is a systematic review that provides clinical evidence regarding nutritional support for diabetic patients.", "GLUCOSE METABOLISM DISORDERS:Glucose metabolism disorders are conditions that are addressed in clinical nutrition literature, particularly in relation to dietary management.)<|COMPLETE|>", "GLUCÓGENO:GLUCÓGENO is a polysaccharide that serves as a crucial form of energy storage in animals and fungi. It primarily exists in the liver and muscle tissues, where it acts as a reserve of glucose, which is essential for various bodily functions. The metabolism of glucógeno is particularly important for muscle activity, influencing physical performance and exercise requirements. Additionally, glucógeno can be synthesized from fructose metabolism when necessary, highlighting its role in carbohydrate storage and energy management within the body. Overall, glucógeno plays a significant role in maintaining energy levels and supporting physical exertion.", "GLUCONEOGÉNESIS:GLUCONEOGÉNESIS es un proceso biológico que se refiere a la síntesis de glucógeno a partir de glucosa, que ocurre principalmente en el hígado y los músculos. Este proceso es fundamental para el almacenamiento de energía en el cuerpo, permitiendo que la glucosa se convierta en glucógeno, que puede ser utilizado posteriormente cuando el organismo necesita energía.", "GLUCOLISIS:La glucogenólisis es el proceso de degradación del glucógeno para liberar glucosa cuando es necesario.", "HEXOKINASA:La hexokinasa es una enzima que fosforila la glucosa para mantenerla dentro de las células durante la glucogenogénesis.", "GLUCÓGENO FOSFORILASA:GLUCÓGENO FOSFORILASA is an enzyme that plays a crucial role in the process of glycogenolysis, which is the breakdown of glycogen into glucose-1-phosphate. This enzyme catalyzes the conversion of glycogen, facilitating the release of glucose-1-phosphate, an important molecule for energy production in the body.", "GLUCOSA-6-FOSFATO:GLUCOSA-6-FOSFATO es un metabolito clave en el metabolismo de la glucosa y la galactosa. Se trata de una forma fosforilada de la glucosa que desempeña un papel fundamental en la glucólisis y el metabolismo del glucógeno. Además, la glucosa-6-fosfato actúa como un intermediario en el metabolismo de la glucosa y es crucial en el proceso de glucogenogénesis.", "GLUCOSA-1-FOSFATO:GLUCOSA-1-FOSFATO is a glucose molecule that has been phosphorylated at the first carbon, making it an important intermediate in glycogen metabolism. It is formed during the conversion of glucose into glycogen, playing a crucial role in the storage and regulation of energy within the body.", "URIDIN-DIFOSFATO-GLUCOSA:El uridin-difosfato-glucosa es un intermediario en la síntesis de glucógeno que se forma a partir de glucosa-1-fosfato.", "ENZIMA RAMIFICANTE:Enzima ramificante is an enzyme that plays a crucial role in the synthesis of glycogen by introducing α-1,6 linkages, which are essential for creating the branched structure of glycogen. This enzyme is responsible for forming the branches in the glycogen structure, facilitating its complex architecture that is vital for energy storage in organisms.", "GLUCÓGENO SINTASA:Glucógeno sintasa is an enzyme responsible for the synthesis of glycogen from glucose, playing a key role in glycogenogenesis."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}